for $n=0,\ldots,7$ (5914 states). HXC uses every family of nonempty subsets
for $n=0,\ldots,4$ (32907 states). Exactly 13 boxes and 38821 states were
executed, without sampling, cutoff expansion or literal repair.

| Pilot | Original terminal box | Image | Recurrent | Max entry | Max fibre |
|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| ORR | $S_7$, 5040 states | 3385 | 2563 | 3 | 13 |
| HXC | $n=4$, 32768 families | 5021 | 52 | 6 | 318 |

